{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a thrilling roguelite adventure where your wits and your backpack are your greatest weapons. In <strong>Papercraft Tactics</strong>, every item you collect and every choice you make shapes your journey. Traverse through branching paths filled with perilous encounters, clever puzzles, and fearsome foes, all leading to an epic boss battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine and optimize the treasures you discover to create the ultimate loadout, ensuring your survival against escalating challenges. With a dark, hand-drawn art style inspired by real life art and animation, immerse yourself in a world where strategy, luck, and resourcefulness are the keys to victory. Will your backpack carry you to triumph\u2014or weigh you down into defeat?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3380700?t=1754461097","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3380700?t=1754461097","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/a485005149e9aae9eb2c57813dbf8e40ae8ca753/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754461097","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380700/a485005149e9aae9eb2c57813dbf8e40ae8ca753/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754461097","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3775350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a thrilling roguelite adventure where your wits and yo